# Environment + credential material. Broad by design: a bare `.env` left
# `.env.production`, `.env.staging` and friends committable. No .env file is
# tracked in this repo, so the wildcard cannot untrack anything; the
# `!.env.example` negation keeps a documented template possible in future.
.env
.env.*
!.env.example
*.age

# Per-project Cursor hooks config — leaks absolute /home/<user>/ paths if committed
.cursor/

